// AWS EBS Snapshot Shared Externally  [tier: alert]  ATT&CK: T1537
// Detects modification of EBS snapshot permissions (ModifySnapshotAttribute). Sharing a snapshot with another AWS account or making it public…
// False positives: Legitimate sharing of snapshots with known partner accounts (allowlist account IDs).
// Source: rules/exfiltration/ec2-modify-snapshot-attribute.yml — generated by scripts/build_dist.py; adjust field names to your CloudTrail schema.
eventName=/^ModifySnapshotAttribute$/i eventSource=/^ec2\.amazonaws\.com$/i
